# CerrarTramite(registro): registers the two physical copies, closes the process and archives its record (UC-003 A3)
# Closing needs the final grade, which UC-006 will register. Until then, set it by hand before the last request,
# from the repository root:
#   docker compose exec postgres psql -U mailapp -d mailapp -c "UPDATE graduation_processes SET stage = 'FINAL_GRADE_RECORDED' WHERE status = 'IN_PROGRESS' AND student_account_id = (SELECT id FROM user_accounts WHERE student_registration_number = '2026101')"
# With docker-compose.dev.yml, add -f docker-compose.dev.yml after "docker compose". Use DB_USER and DB_NAME of .env.
# Sends the commands to mail-app through the Mailpit API. The replies arrive after the next poll: see mailbox.http.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8025
@systemAddress = sistema@mailapp.local
@adminAddress = admin@mailapp.local
@secretaryAddress = secretaria@mailapp.local
@studentAddress = juan.soto@mailapp.local
@registration = 2026101

### Rejected: the process does not have the final grade yet
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "From": { "Email": "{{secretaryAddress}}" },
  "To": [{ "Email": "{{systemAddress}}" }],
  "Subject": "CerrarTramite({{registration}})",
  "Text": ""
}

### Close the process, after setting the final grade with the psql command above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "From": { "Email": "{{secretaryAddress}}" },
  "To": [{ "Email": "{{systemAddress}}" }],
  "Subject": "CerrarTramite({{registration}})",
  "Text": ""
}
